# Copy to .env (which is GITIGNORED — the path is machine-specific) and point it at your own disc
# image of Mega Man X4 (USA), SLUS-00561. The image is never shipped with this repo.
#
# Resolution order (tools/resolve_disc.py is the ONE implementation): a CLI argument >
# $PSXPORT_X4_DISC > this file > a *.chd dropped in the repo root.
#
# The key PSXPORT_X4_DISC is spelled identically in exactly three places, and they must not diverge:
# here, GameConfig::discEnvVar (game/core/game_config.cpp), and tools/resolve_disc.py's ENV_KEY.
PSXPORT_X4_DISC=/path/to/Mega Man X4 (USA).chd

# Optional: where the native memory-card image lives. Defaults to scratch/saves/megamanx4.mcr.
#PSXPORT_X4_CARD=/path/to/megamanx4.mcr
